OL,3,GNEWSABid launched to replace
OL,4,A123-year-old road bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 123-year-old road bridge near Boston
OL,7,Fcould be replaced with a new crossing.
OL,9,FLincolnshire County Council has applied
OL,10,Ffor government funding to replace the
OL,11,FLangrick bridge.
OL,13,FThe single-lane iron structure was
OL,14,Fbuilt in 1903 to replace a ferry
OL,15,Fservice and carries the B1192 over the
OL,16,FRiver Witham, connecting the village of
OL,17,FLangrick Bridge to the south with
OL,18,FLangrick to the north.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
