OL,3,GNEWSABid launched to replace
OL,4,A123-year-old road bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the bridge had a
OL,7,Fnumber of problems, including its
OL,8,Fnarrow width, restricted weight
OL,9,Fcapacity, escalating maintenance costs
OL,10,Fand structural issues.
